<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-14-14/pertinencia> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-14-14> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
