<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-15-5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "pp. impresas 438; pp. del PDF 441" <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-15-5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ficha del catálogo CCc 15 (5)" <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-15-5> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#describesOrDescribed> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/expediente/ccc-15-5> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-15-5> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasConstituentOf> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/intendencia-tomo-1> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-15-5> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#scopeAndContent> "Expediente 5. Año: 1807.\nEl sargento Evaristo Cortes de Yábar, denuncia a Don Pascual Pareja, alcalde mayor de la parroquia de san\nJerónimo, ya que el acusado es acostumbrado a dichas injurias, es por ello que pide que se le aplique la ley y\nque este sea castigado, para poder ratificar dicha culpa se tomó la declaración a Don pascual.\nFolios: 9." <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-19-24/pertinencia> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "PC03: menciona Tinta; calificador(es): pueblo" <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
