<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/coc-88-25> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ficha del catálogo COc 88 (25)" <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/coc-88-25> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#describesOrDescribed> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/expediente/coc-88-25> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
