<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/cop-3-13/pertinencia> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasGeneratedBy> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/actividad/extraccion-catalogo-v1> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/procedencia> .
