<https://w3id.org/laad/id/inferencia/R-ayllu-tinta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/argumentacion/R-ayllu-tinta> .
