<https://w3id.org/laad/id/inferencia/R-cargo-chuquitapa-cacique> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14_carried_out_by> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/agente/claude-opus-5-5> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/argumentacion/R-cargo-chuquitapa-cacique> .
