<https://w3id.org/laad/id/inferencia/R-declarante-p19-es-martin> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P17_was_motivated_by> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/cc-14-18/afirmacion/A-UT12b-002> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/argumentacion/R-declarante-p19-es-martin> .
