<https://w3id.org/laad/id/inferencia/R-huancachoque-alias-ortiz> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I5_Inference_Making> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/argumentacion/R-huancachoque-alias-ortiz> .
